          "end": 3.69,
          "en": "Now, slowly but steadily,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.69,
          "end": 5.939,
          "en": "we're reaching the end of this section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.939,
          "end": 9.48,
          "en": "but there are some additional prompting techniques.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.48,
          "end": 11.355,
          "en": "I wanna explore together with you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.355,
          "end": 14.31,
          "en": "before we end this course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.31,
          "end": 16.59,
          "en": "For example, contextual prompting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.59,
          "end": 19.571,
          "en": "emotional prompting, laddering prompting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.571,
          "end": 23.07,
          "en": "and many more though I will come back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.07,
          "end": 27.27,
          "en": "to that many more part a little bit later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.27,
          "end": 30.557,
          "en": "So let's actually start with contextual prompting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.557,
          "end": 33.779,
          "en": "Contextual prompting simply means that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.779,
          "end": 37.837,
          "en": "as you provide extra information to your prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.837,
          "end": 40.739,
          "en": "so as you set the context of your prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.739,
          "end": 45.32,
          "en": "you add specific extra information on the cultural,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.32,
          "end": 49.88,
          "en": "historical or situational factors that should be taken",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.88,
          "end": 54.781,
          "en": "into account by ChatGPT as it generates the response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.781,
          "end": 58.378,
          "en": "For example, you could have a prompt like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.378,
          "end": 63.378,
          "en": "Here, I want ChatGPT to generate a summary of the evolution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.76,
          "end": 68.6,
          "en": "of the combustion engine over the years since its inception.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.6,
          "end": 72.377,
          "en": "But I also specifically want ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.377,
          "end": 76.19800000000001,
          "en": "to take the current shift towards renewable energy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 76.19800000000001,
          "end": 79,
          "en": "and electric vehicles into account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 79,
          "end": 83.277,
          "en": "And that's the part where I do provide some extra historical",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.277,
          "end": 86.777,
          "en": "and situational context, because otherwise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 86.777,
          "end": 90.33500000000001,
          "en": "ChatGPT might focus on the history",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 90.33500000000001,
          "end": 95.261,
          "en": "of the combustion engine without taking the current changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 95.261,
          "end": 97.64,
          "en": "that are taking place into account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 97.64,
          "end": 101.055,
          "en": "And with that extra paragraph added here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 101.055,
          "end": 103.08,
          "en": "that's hopefully different.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.08,
          "end": 108.07900000000001,
          "en": "So adding this extra information about this extra context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 108.07900000000001,
          "end": 112.979,
          "en": "into which the response should be put, or the extra context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 112.979,
          "end": 116.196,
          "en": "of the current circumstances that should be considered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 116.196,
          "end": 120.276,
          "en": "adding this extra information can be very important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 120.276,
          "end": 123.831,
          "en": "for certain kinds of prompts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 123.831,
          "end": 127.44,
          "en": "And as always, of course not for all prompts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 127.44,
          "end": 130.424,
          "en": "this is definitely not important for all prompts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 130.424,
          "end": 134.563,
          "en": "but for some prompts, taking current circumstances",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 134.563,
          "end": 139.05,
          "en": "or specific aspects into account could be important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 139.05,
          "end": 142.198,
          "en": "And with contextual prompting, you in the end do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 142.198,
          "end": 144.753,
          "en": "add this extra information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 145.77,
          "end": 149.52,
          "en": "So therefore, in the end, contextual prompting is of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 149.52,
          "end": 152.92000000000002,
          "en": "still only about adding extra information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 152.92000000000002,
          "end": 156.75,
          "en": "about setting the context of the prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 156.75,
          "end": 159.3,
          "en": "And the deal for in the end still comes down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 159.3,
          "end": 162.621,
          "en": "to these two core elements where you have a goal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 162.621,
          "end": 165.88,
          "en": "and you then do add this extra context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 165.88,
          "end": 168.355,
          "en": "this extra additional information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 168.355,
          "end": 172.32,
          "en": "But it's a specific kind of extra information which is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 172.32,
          "end": 175.77,
          "en": "easy to overlook, or which you might not always think",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 175.77,
          "end": 178.237,
          "en": "about, but which can make certain responses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 178.237,
          "end": 181.019,
          "en": "for certain prompts way better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 181.019,
          "end": 182.995,
          "en": "Like here, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 182.995,
          "end": 185.73,
          "en": "where we do get this extra information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 185.73,
          "end": 188.499,
          "en": "about the impact of the combustion engine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 188.499,
          "end": 191.556,
          "en": "both the positive and the negative impact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 191.556,
          "end": 195.859,
          "en": "and we get a whole paragraph dedicated to the current shift",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
